%R	36472	1519859	72	11571	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode"" http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=GENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001""></HEAD><BODY><P class=MsoNormal style=""MARGIN: 0in""><FONT face=Calibri>During installation of Inlet 7 at the NE corner of Madison and 9<SUP>th</SUP> we encountered a duct bank in conflict with the inlet. We backfilled the excavation and will return to the work when we have direction. All the time today on Inlet 007 was tracked and will be submitted for reimbursement. </FONT><?xml:namespace prefix = ""o"" ns = ""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"" /><o:p></o:p></P></BODY></HTML>
%R	36473	1522096	72	11571	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode"" http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=GENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001""></HEAD><BODY><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ""Calibri"",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'>During installation of inlet 8A we discovered multiple unknown utilities in conflict with the structure. We have tracked the time and will await direction from the city. </SPAN></BODY></HTML>
