%R	36475	1522100	72	11571	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode"" http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=GENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001""></HEAD><BODY><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ""Calibri"",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'>During installation of the Storm Mainline we discovered what appears to be a side sewer that is in conflict with the mainline at STA 281+90.</SPAN></BODY></HTML>
